    "title": "The Value Meal Comes to the Brewery - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By Joshua M. Bernstein ,\n15 hours ago Late last year, the management team at Three Roads Brewing, which operates taprooms in Farmville and Lynchburg, Va., considered the McDonald’s McValue Menu. It delivered dependable daily deals, such as crispy chicken sandwiches and double cheeseburgers for around $3 each. Why not create a similar value-driven beer menu for Three Roads? Read full article\nRead in NewsBreak",
